Data
----
Every transcript in demo/ai-actas-bot/evals/dataset.jsonl is synthetic. The people, teams,
dates and decisions in them are invented. No customer data and no internal figures from any
employer appear in this repository, by design: the talk is about architecture, not about a
client.

Fixtures
--------
demo/ai-actas-bot/evals/fixtures/ contains model responses used by the replay mode of the
evaluator. They were produced synthetically (this repository was written without an Azure
subscription) and are marked as such in each file. Run `make record` against a real
deployment to replace them with genuine model output. The evaluator code paths for live and
replay mode are identical; only the transport changes.

Credentials
-----------
No subscription ids, endpoints, keys or tokens are committed. `.env.example` contains
placeholders only. The CI workflow authenticates to Azure through GitHub OIDC — there is no
stored secret in this design, which is the point of the design.
